Web bekerja dengan pola **permintaan dan respons** (*request/response*): klien (browser, aplikasi HP) mengirim permintaan, server membalas dengan respons.

Node.js bisa menjadi server HTTP dengan modul bawaan `node:http`:

```js
import http from 'node:http';

const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  res.end('Halo dari server toko');
});
server.listen(3000, () => console.log('Server jalan di http://localhost:3000'));
```

Fungsi di `createServer` dipanggil **setiap kali** ada permintaan masuk. `req` berisi permintaan, `res` dipakai untuk membalas.

Ibarat loket pelayanan: server duduk di loket nomor 3000 (port), menunggu orang datang. Setiap orang yang datang (request) dilayani dan diberi jawaban (response).

cards.code:
import http from 'node:http';

let nomor = 0;
const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  nomor++;
  res.end(`Halo, kamu pengunjung ke-${nomor}`);
});
server.listen(3000, () => console.log('Server jalan di http://localhost:3000'));

const r1 = await fetch('http://localhost:3000');
console.log(r1.status, await r1.text());
const r2 = await fetch('http://localhost:3000/menu');
console.log(r2.status, await r2.text());
server.close(() => console.log('Server ditutup'));

langkah.jawaban:
import http from 'node:http';
const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  res.end('Selamat datang di Toko Sari');
});
server.listen(3000);
const r = await fetch('http://localhost:3000');
console.log(await r.text());
server.close();

import http from 'node:http';
const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  res.end(`Kamu membuka ${req.url}`);
});
server.listen(3000);
const r = await fetch('http://localhost:3000/menu');
console.log(await r.text());
server.close();

import http from 'node:http';
const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;
const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  res.end(`Kamu membuka ${req.url}`);
});
server.listen(PORT, () => console.log(`Server jalan di port ${PORT}`));
const r = await fetch(`http://localhost:${PORT}/menu`);
console.log(await r.text());
server.close();

